[[File:5.3 Memory Head.png|thumb|234x234px|Post Beta 5.3]]
Memory Head started with 3/3 for 4G. '''Beta 5.3''' buffed that with +1 HP. Its effect allowed the user to send a random card in their opponent's hand back into their deck.
[[File:Memory Head (Beta 47.1).png|thumb|230x230px|Beta 47.1]]
After a long time, '''Beta 47.1''' reworked it. Now, as a 6/5 for 5G, its new Magic affects yourself, sending a random card from your hand back into your deck. However, a new duplicate of that card will also be added. But it will not choose another Memory Head nor a Determination card.

'''Beta 53.0''' reworked it again. Now, as a 2/2/2, its Magic will add an exact copy of itself to your hand, but only if the Magic comes from a non-Generated Memory Head. So only those that started in your deck will activate their Magic.

